    {
      "name": "Defensive Spines",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>When a creature enters the stonefish swarm's space, that creature takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> piercing damage and is exposed to stonefish swarm venom.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Reef Camouflage",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Until the next time it acts, the stonefish swarm appears to be a colorful coral reef. It has an automatic result of 26 on Deception checks and DCs to pass as a reef.</p>",
